1
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:16,110
This is good,

2
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:18,680
but not as thrilling as riding a horse.

3
00:00:19,430 --> 00:00:20,710
I heard you

4
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:23,370
smashed the Second Batou's Xuande Jar.

5
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:27,180
He's quick to talk.

6
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,380
Good job smashing it.

7
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,340
To do big business,

8
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,040
you have to be willing to invest.

9
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,530
What you say makes sense.

10
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:36,830
Then how about

11
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:38,910
you add some more capital?

12
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:39,790
Sure.

13
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:42,910
What do I get?

14
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,350
I'll get you a new house.

15
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:45,750
And an American car,

16
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,060
how about that?

17
00:00:48,270 --> 00:00:49,270
So generous?

18
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:50,550
Sure.

19
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:51,870
That's wonderful.

20
00:00:53,130 --> 00:00:53,890
So filial.

21
00:00:54,090 --> 00:00:56,040
Who taught you to be so filial?

22
00:00:56,070 --> 00:00:58,150
Your mother or your mentor?

23
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:09,820
Living under someone else's roof,

24
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:10,990
I have no choice.

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:12,580
Poor thing.

26
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:19,350
Wanna try?

27
00:03:10,450 --> 00:03:14,220
[A Prophet]

28
00:03:15,030 --> 00:03:17,370
[Episode 15]

29
00:03:19,070 --> 00:03:20,070
This old eunuch

30
00:03:20,070 --> 00:03:22,930
insists the thumb ring
Fifth Master gave us is fake.

31
00:03:23,230 --> 00:03:24,190
And...

32
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:29,790
What are you looking at me for?

33
00:03:29,790 --> 00:03:30,750
Go on.

34
00:03:33,910 --> 00:03:34,750
Second Master,

35
00:03:34,750 --> 00:03:35,510
he said

36
00:03:35,510 --> 00:03:37,450
the real dragon throne
should have a crack underneath,

37
00:03:37,450 --> 00:03:39,450
caused by Emperor Xuantong's kick.

38
00:03:42,910 --> 00:03:44,240
What are you looking at?

39
00:03:44,660 --> 00:03:46,980
How would I know Xuantong
kicked the dragon throne?

40
00:03:46,980 --> 00:03:49,450
Second Brother,
your craftsmanship is flawless.

41
00:03:49,450 --> 00:03:50,250
Masters,

42
00:03:50,270 --> 00:03:52,430
this eunuch is clearly coming for us.

43
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:53,710
If he exposes the scam,

44
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:54,990
we're all doomed.

45
00:03:57,760 --> 00:04:00,010
I told you to pull out, but you didn't.

46
00:04:00,030 --> 00:04:01,900
Now his wife is back
to mess things up.

47
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:02,650
I think

48
00:04:03,030 --> 00:04:04,540
the 70% cut is gone.

49
00:04:04,860 --> 00:04:05,420
t1

50
00:04:08,230 --> 00:04:09,030
Sixth Master,

51
00:04:09,630 --> 00:04:11,030
it's your turn.

52
00:04:17,260 --> 00:04:18,630
Don't boss me around.

53
00:04:18,779 --> 00:04:20,190
I'll settle the score with you

54
00:04:20,190 --> 00:04:21,670
after this game.

55
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:35,230
Your Majesty.

56
00:04:39,670 --> 00:04:40,550
Madam.

57
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:41,950
Honey?

58
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:43,900
Honey, why are you here?

59
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:47,280
-Greetings, Your Majesty.
-Greetings, Your Majesty.

60
00:04:49,070 --> 00:04:49,990
Rise.

61
00:04:52,380 --> 00:04:54,670
You guys put on quite a show.

62
00:04:54,900 --> 00:04:57,020
You bunch of swindlers.

63
00:04:57,820 --> 00:04:58,870
And you—

64
00:04:58,870 --> 00:05:00,670
you little vixen.

65
00:05:00,670 --> 00:05:02,580
I'll make sure you don't
leave here alive today.

66
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:03,510
Watch how I deal with you—

67
00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:04,020
What are you doing?

68
00:05:04,020 --> 00:05:05,140
You're asking me what I'm doing?

69
00:05:05,140 --> 00:05:06,340
What are you doing?

70
00:05:07,340 --> 00:05:08,140
Cao San!

71
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,840
You absolute fool.

72
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:11,570
I brought the eunuch here today.

73
00:05:11,570 --> 00:05:13,490
Your pipe dream is over!

74
00:05:14,130 --> 00:05:15,890
And you swindlers—

75
00:05:16,550 --> 00:05:18,220
none of you will get away!

76
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:18,550
Madam.

77
00:05:18,550 --> 00:05:19,380
Your Majesty.

78
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:20,110
You...

79
00:05:20,110 --> 00:05:21,140
Madam.

80
00:05:21,140 --> 00:05:22,190
Calm down.

81
00:05:22,190 --> 00:05:23,380
Let me see.

82
00:05:31,870 --> 00:05:33,430
Back when

83
00:05:33,580 --> 00:05:35,550
the Eight-Nation Alliance
entered the capital,

84
00:05:35,550 --> 00:05:36,670
a German barbarian

85
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:39,820
named Waldersee

86
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:41,640
acted wildly in the palace.

87
00:05:41,670 --> 00:05:42,940
Not only did he sit on the dragon throne,

88
00:05:42,940 --> 00:05:45,540
but he also had his servants
take a photo of him.

89
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:49,220
In the end, he was decapitated

90
00:05:49,550 --> 00:05:51,010
and died a gruesome death.

91
00:05:51,220 --> 00:05:53,870
He didn't even know how he died.

92
00:05:54,580 --> 00:05:56,460
The authentic Dragon Throne

93
00:05:56,990 --> 00:05:58,250
is a national treasure

94
00:05:58,510 --> 00:05:59,780
that converges

95
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:02,510
the Three Powers
of Heaven, Earth, and Humanity.

96
00:06:04,340 --> 00:06:07,140
It's full of Yang energy.

97
00:06:07,700 --> 00:06:08,580
So,

98
00:06:08,780 --> 00:06:10,580
anyone who usurps the throne

99
00:06:11,020 --> 00:06:12,310
will die a horrible death.

100
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:13,110
Did you hear that?

101
00:06:13,110 --> 00:06:14,110
A horrible death.

102
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:15,310
Sect Leader Cao,

103
00:06:15,510 --> 00:06:17,630
if this is the real dragon throne,

104
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:21,430
I advise you not to touch it.

105
00:06:35,550 --> 00:06:37,510
He is that Eastern dragon!

106
00:06:37,550 --> 00:06:37,950
Quick,

107
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:39,220
protect the Emperor!

108
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:48,100
Watch out, Your Majesty!

109
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,770
My beloved concubine.

110
00:06:53,950 --> 00:06:54,820
My beloved concubine.

111
00:06:54,820 --> 00:06:56,220
Cao San.

112
00:06:57,870 --> 00:06:58,460
Doggie,

113
00:06:58,700 --> 00:06:59,900
protect the Emperor!

114
00:06:59,990 --> 00:07:00,380
Honey!

115
00:07:00,380 --> 00:07:00,870
Cao San.

116
00:07:00,870 --> 00:07:01,110
Honey!

117
00:07:01,110 --> 00:07:01,700
They...

118
00:07:14,510 --> 00:07:15,380
Drop the act.

119
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,640
Let's all go back to the hall.

120
00:07:25,460 --> 00:07:26,520
What are you doing?

121
00:07:26,670 --> 00:07:28,130
There's one we didn't use.

122
00:07:29,780 --> 00:07:32,220
State Preceptor!

123
00:07:32,310 --> 00:07:33,990
Open the door! State Preceptor!

124
00:07:33,990 --> 00:07:35,140
Quick!

125
00:07:35,340 --> 00:07:36,340
State Preceptor!

126
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:37,820
What happened?

127
00:07:37,820 --> 00:07:38,990
The bed!

128
00:07:38,990 --> 00:07:40,020
Over here.

129
00:07:40,730 --> 00:07:41,900
I'm fine.

130
00:07:42,290 --> 00:07:43,950
Quickly, check if His Majesty

131
00:07:44,260 --> 00:07:45,460
is hurt.

132
00:07:45,460 --> 00:07:46,580
What exactly happened?

133
00:07:46,580 --> 00:07:47,780
Some people suddenly rushed in.

134
00:07:47,780 --> 00:07:49,040
They looked Japanese.

135
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:50,510
They started shooting right away,

136
00:07:50,510 --> 00:07:52,510
almost hurting His Majesty.

137
00:07:52,670 --> 00:07:53,460
Your Majesty!

138
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:54,050
Your Majesty!

139
00:07:54,050 --> 00:07:55,780
Let me check if you're injured.

140
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:57,340
I'm fine.

141
00:07:57,670 --> 00:07:59,670
Go find a doctor for Miss Jiang

142
00:07:59,670 --> 00:08:01,340
immediately.

143
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:02,600
No,

144
00:08:02,620 --> 00:08:04,420
that will attract the Japanese.

145
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,940
An assassination attempt

146
00:08:05,980 --> 00:08:08,340
means His Majesty's identity
and whereabouts are exposed.

147
00:08:08,340 --> 00:08:09,460
The most important thing now

148
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:11,630
is to move His Majesty to a safe place.

149
00:08:11,630 --> 00:08:12,900
Your Majesty, your health is the priority.

150
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:14,260
As your subjects,

151
00:08:14,510 --> 00:08:17,070
it's our duty even if we die.

152
00:08:17,310 --> 00:08:18,210
Yes, Your Majesty.

153
00:08:18,210 --> 00:08:19,060
Exactly.

154
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:21,370
It's our duty to risk our lives for you,

155
00:08:21,550 --> 00:08:23,460
Your Majesty.

156
00:08:23,460 --> 00:08:24,510
I'm fine.

157
00:08:25,110 --> 00:08:26,550
Duty?

158
00:08:26,670 --> 00:08:27,780
My goodness,

159
00:08:28,190 --> 00:08:29,820
you bunch of frauds.

160
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:31,430
Your Majesty!

161
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:32,419
Don't...

162
00:08:32,419 --> 00:08:33,090
Don't get up.

163
00:08:33,090 --> 00:08:34,690
Greetings, Your Majesty...

164
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:36,770
Get up!

165
00:08:39,110 --> 00:08:41,510
Where did this little street rat
come from?

166
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:43,460
First time seeing you.

167
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:46,060
You must be the leader of these frauds.

168
00:08:47,150 --> 00:08:48,550
Calm down, Your Majesty.

169
00:08:48,620 --> 00:08:51,100
I am completely loyal to the Emperor.

170
00:08:51,330 --> 00:08:52,920
Still acting in front of me?

171
00:08:52,950 --> 00:08:54,500
You guys really love acting.

172
00:08:54,500 --> 00:08:55,580
If you love it so much,

173
00:08:55,580 --> 00:08:57,920
I'll build a stage for you
to act all you want.

174
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:59,520
And you, you little vixen,

175
00:08:59,550 --> 00:09:01,260
finally showing your true colors.

176
00:09:01,260 --> 00:09:02,790
How dare you steal my man?

177
00:09:02,810 --> 00:09:04,020
Do you know

178
00:09:04,050 --> 00:09:05,960
I saved this man's life?

179
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,660
What are you doing?

180
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:09,980
Your Majesty,

181
00:09:09,980 --> 00:09:11,070
are you okay?

182
00:09:11,740 --> 00:09:12,620
Enough!

183
00:09:13,700 --> 00:09:14,700
Cao San!

184
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:16,390
You dare hit me

185
00:09:16,390 --> 00:09:17,670
for this vixen?

186
00:09:17,670 --> 00:09:19,270
She's not a vixen.

187
00:09:19,550 --> 00:09:20,390
Look at

188
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:23,460
how badly she's hurt for me.

189
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:24,740
And them—

190
00:09:25,150 --> 00:09:27,500
they are all my loyal subjects.

191
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:30,320
-Your Majesty is wise.
-Your Majesty is wise.

192
00:09:30,980 --> 00:09:32,190
My god...

193
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:33,150
Oh my goodness!

194
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:34,910
You've all really gone mad!

195
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:37,710
Eunuch.

196
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:39,670
Quick, tell him

197
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:40,950
they are all frauds.

198
00:09:40,950 --> 00:09:42,480
That dragon throne is fake.

199
00:09:44,620 --> 00:09:45,620
Say something!

200
00:09:45,620 --> 00:09:47,030
Speak up!

201
00:09:52,210 --> 00:09:54,920
Which banner are you from?

202
00:10:04,410 --> 00:10:06,070
I am of the Plain White Banner,

203
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,780
with the Manchu surname Fuca.

204
00:10:09,700 --> 00:10:10,460
Madam,

205
00:10:11,430 --> 00:10:12,460
I've taken a look.

206
00:10:12,580 --> 00:10:14,030
That dragon throne

207
00:10:14,030 --> 00:10:14,910
is real.

208
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:17,390
It's the very one
from the Hall of Supreme Harmony.

209
00:10:17,390 --> 00:10:18,030
Look,

210
00:10:18,050 --> 00:10:20,050
I've been looking at it for over 20 years.

211
00:10:20,050 --> 00:10:21,190
I wouldn't be mistaken.

212
00:10:21,190 --> 00:10:22,070
Impossible.

213
00:10:22,950 --> 00:10:24,640
These people are all scammers.

214
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:26,400
I just asked them in Manchu,

215
00:10:26,490 --> 00:10:28,300
and they really are Bannermen.

216
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:30,490
You're in cahoots with them.

217
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:31,520
You old scammer!

218
00:10:32,210 --> 00:10:32,890
Madam,

219
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:34,780
you asked me to come
and appraise it for you.

220
00:10:34,780 --> 00:10:36,780
I was in the palace for over 20 years.

221
00:10:36,910 --> 00:10:38,310
Even the masters couldn't bear

222
00:10:38,310 --> 00:10:39,670
to lay a finger on me.

223
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:40,670
And you actually...

224
00:10:40,670 --> 00:10:41,500
All right.

225
00:10:41,910 --> 00:10:43,460
Even the eunuch you found

226
00:10:43,670 --> 00:10:45,500
said the throne was real.

227
00:10:45,500 --> 00:10:47,740
What else is there to say?

228
00:10:47,740 --> 00:10:49,740
Can't you wish me well?

229
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:51,550
How can I make you Empress

230
00:10:52,030 --> 00:10:53,790
when you're acting like this?

231
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:54,690
Your Majesty.

232
00:10:54,690 --> 00:10:55,500
Don't pull me!

233
00:10:55,540 --> 00:10:57,100
Your Majesty, please stop arguing.

234
00:10:57,100 --> 00:10:58,250
Her Majesty

235
00:10:58,280 --> 00:11:00,610
is just unable to accept this so suddenly.

236
00:11:00,790 --> 00:11:02,010
Please don't blame her.

237
00:11:02,010 --> 00:11:03,560
Get away, you little vixen!

238
00:11:05,150 --> 00:11:06,390
I'll kill you.

239
00:11:06,410 --> 00:11:07,960
Still seducing him, huh?

240
00:11:08,310 --> 00:11:10,260
Are you trying to rebel?

241
00:11:10,460 --> 00:11:11,580
How dare you hit me!

242
00:11:11,620 --> 00:11:12,460
Someone!

243
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:14,820
Summon the imperial physician for me!

244
00:11:14,820 --> 00:11:15,460
Cao San!

245
00:11:15,700 --> 00:11:16,950
You're ridiculous!

246
00:11:17,910 --> 00:11:19,310
Calm down, Your Majesty.

247
00:11:19,460 --> 00:11:20,430
Calm down, Your Majesty.

248
00:11:20,430 --> 00:11:21,190
Your Majesty!

249
00:11:21,190 --> 00:11:21,990
Your Majesty!

250
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:25,890
It's done.

251
00:11:26,620 --> 00:11:27,740
Scammer.

252
00:11:27,910 --> 00:11:29,030
Scammer.

253
00:11:33,150 --> 00:11:34,070
Miss Jiang,

254
00:11:34,460 --> 00:11:35,790
I need you to promise me.

255
00:11:36,340 --> 00:11:38,100
You must recover well.

256
00:11:39,090 --> 00:11:40,090
State Preceptor.

257
00:11:40,150 --> 00:11:42,670
I'm leaving Miss Jiang in your care.

258
00:11:42,860 --> 00:11:44,460
You must cure her.

259
00:11:44,620 --> 00:11:46,220
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

260
00:11:47,430 --> 00:11:49,190
Cao San, come out!

261
00:11:49,210 --> 00:11:50,480
You blockhead.

262
00:11:50,700 --> 00:11:52,430
You've lost your mind.

263
00:11:53,690 --> 00:11:55,270
I haven't even ascended the throne yet,

264
00:11:55,270 --> 00:11:57,670
and the harem is already this noisy.

265
00:11:59,820 --> 00:12:01,080
My beloved concubine,

266
00:12:01,340 --> 00:12:02,740
recover well.

267
00:12:02,890 --> 00:12:05,250
I will come see you again tomorrow.

268
00:12:05,340 --> 00:12:06,150
Your Majesty,

269
00:12:06,820 --> 00:12:08,190
don't worry.

270
00:12:20,310 --> 00:12:21,620
I didn't expect

271
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:26,980
this gold-lacquered carved dragon throne
really has the aura of a true dragon.

272
00:12:26,980 --> 00:12:28,580
I said it had a crack,

273
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:31,610
and it actually did.

274
00:12:35,220 --> 00:12:36,220
May I ask, Eunuch,

275
00:12:36,910 --> 00:12:38,240
what do you mean by that?

276
00:12:38,620 --> 00:12:39,980
I deliberately said

277
00:12:40,030 --> 00:12:41,960
that the dragon throne had a crack.

278
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:43,740
Those who don't know better

279
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:45,220
would think this dragon throne

280
00:12:45,220 --> 00:12:47,030
is made of golden thread nanmu.

281
00:12:47,820 --> 00:12:50,100
But the main material of the dragon throne

282
00:12:50,100 --> 00:12:51,460
is brass.

283
00:12:52,100 --> 00:12:54,410
Can a child really crack

284
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:57,530
a gold-painted brass dragon chair
with a kick?

285
00:13:01,860 --> 00:13:03,500
You bunch of frauds.

286
00:13:04,190 --> 00:13:06,320
You're still not taking it seriously.

287
00:13:09,430 --> 00:13:11,520
Whether we're taking it seriously or not

288
00:13:11,520 --> 00:13:12,800
depends on if you can

289
00:13:13,150 --> 00:13:14,790
walk out that door today.

290
00:13:18,150 --> 00:13:18,670
What?

291
00:13:19,430 --> 00:13:20,760
You're going to kill me?

292
00:13:21,700 --> 00:13:22,430
Fine.

293
00:13:23,220 --> 00:13:24,620
Once I die,

294
00:13:25,030 --> 00:13:26,030
it won't be long

295
00:13:26,310 --> 00:13:27,970
before Cao San figures it out.

296
00:13:29,420 --> 00:13:32,750
Trading my old life
with one foot in the grave

297
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:34,090
for yours

298
00:13:35,460 --> 00:13:36,700
is worth it.

299
00:13:37,740 --> 00:13:38,620
Old sir,

300
00:13:39,340 --> 00:13:40,190
why...

301
00:13:40,860 --> 00:13:41,920
are you doing this?

302
00:13:42,150 --> 00:13:43,070
Very simple.

303
00:13:43,700 --> 00:13:44,700
Let's make a deal.

304
00:13:45,550 --> 00:13:46,340
Interested?

305
00:13:47,700 --> 00:13:48,700
What kind of deal?

306
00:13:50,980 --> 00:13:52,410
Help me kill Cao San.

307
00:13:56,270 --> 00:13:56,860
Eunuch,

308
00:13:57,550 --> 00:13:58,100
this will

309
00:13:58,630 --> 00:14:01,150
start a blood feud with the Beggar Sect.

310
00:14:01,790 --> 00:14:03,030
I am a eunuch

311
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:05,430
with no sons or daughters.

312
00:14:05,430 --> 00:14:08,160
I went back to my hometown
and adopted 2 children.

313
00:14:08,620 --> 00:14:10,880
A few years ago,
I took them to the street,

314
00:14:11,790 --> 00:14:13,460
and they suddenly went missing.

315
00:14:13,460 --> 00:14:16,190
I searched for a long time
but couldn't find them.

316
00:14:18,990 --> 00:14:21,580
A few months ago, I saw them

317
00:14:22,670 --> 00:14:24,340
begging on the street.

318
00:14:26,580 --> 00:14:28,580
They were completely crippled!

319
00:14:30,030 --> 00:14:31,430
Dirty work like this

320
00:14:31,580 --> 00:14:33,460
was done by Cao San and his gang.

321
00:14:34,070 --> 00:14:36,190
I just want to see those bastards

322
00:14:36,190 --> 00:14:39,220
go to hell with my own eyes.

323
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:41,410
Then you could just find a chance

324
00:14:41,980 --> 00:14:43,820
to trade your life for his.

325
00:14:44,030 --> 00:14:45,230
Why drag us into this?

326
00:14:46,100 --> 00:14:47,860
Since we have a common enemy,

327
00:14:48,310 --> 00:14:49,950
then we are friends now.

328
00:14:51,550 --> 00:14:52,340
This is a deal

329
00:14:53,700 --> 00:14:54,550
then.

330
00:14:55,390 --> 00:14:56,580
It's a deal.

331
00:14:56,670 --> 00:14:57,820
It's a deal.

332
00:14:58,310 --> 00:14:59,220
Shangguan Chengming.

333
00:14:59,220 --> 00:15:00,730
Since ancient times,

334
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:02,620
Tianxiang Sect has been setting things up

335
00:15:02,620 --> 00:15:03,740
to make money.

336
00:15:04,270 --> 00:15:05,030
At first,

337
00:15:05,150 --> 00:15:06,700
you wanted to sell fake treasures
to make money.

338
00:15:06,700 --> 00:15:08,430
I gave you the Xuande Jar
without a second thought,

339
00:15:08,430 --> 00:15:09,070
right?

340
00:15:09,460 --> 00:15:09,950
Then,

341
00:15:10,310 --> 00:15:12,980
the jar was smashed,
and I didn't see a single dime.

342
00:15:12,980 --> 00:15:13,510
And then,

343
00:15:13,740 --> 00:15:15,580
you wanted to sell some pipe dream.

344
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:15,980
Fine.

345
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:17,840
I made a dragon throne for you.

346
00:15:17,910 --> 00:15:18,430
Now,

347
00:15:18,860 --> 00:15:20,400
you want to destroy the Beggar Sect.

348
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:21,100
Let me ask you,

349
00:15:21,100 --> 00:15:22,980
are you playing us for fools?

350
00:15:23,580 --> 00:15:25,580
It's a pity if you don't lie to a fool.

351
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:26,420
Calm down,

352
00:15:26,950 --> 00:15:27,810
Second Master.

353
00:15:28,390 --> 00:15:29,640
How could this scam not make money?

354
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:30,500
C-Cut the crap.

355
00:15:31,190 --> 00:15:32,700
Compensate me for the Xuande Jar first.

356
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:33,550
I will after we finish this.

357
00:15:33,550 --> 00:15:35,010
Do it yourself if you want.

358
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:36,070
I quit.

359
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:38,200
Second Brother.

360
00:15:38,270 --> 00:15:38,620
Hey—

361
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:45,500
Sixth Brother, why don't we just

362
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:47,240
call off this scam?

363
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:50,090
If Shangguan Chengming
keeps making trouble,

364
00:15:50,090 --> 00:15:52,310
I'm afraid he'll drag down
the whole Tianxiang Sect.

365
00:15:52,310 --> 00:15:53,740
If anything goes wrong,

366
00:15:53,790 --> 00:15:55,990
how can we explain it to the Sect Master?

367
00:15:56,530 --> 00:15:57,740
Makes sense.

368
00:15:58,040 --> 00:16:00,800
Since all the Batous want to stop,

369
00:16:01,150 --> 00:16:02,190
let's call off

370
00:16:03,030 --> 00:16:03,860
this scam.

371
00:16:05,220 --> 00:16:06,860
Then wouldn't all the money
we spent before

372
00:16:06,860 --> 00:16:07,820
be wasted?

373
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:10,350
How could it be wasted?

374
00:16:10,700 --> 00:16:11,980
Not at all.

375
00:16:12,190 --> 00:16:13,320
It's all on your tab.

376
00:16:14,150 --> 00:16:14,910
Brother,

377
00:16:15,550 --> 00:16:17,010
forget about the emperor.

378
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:18,150
It's over.

379
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:29,580
What should we do, bro?

380
00:16:30,580 --> 00:16:32,420
Why aren't you anxious at all?

381
00:16:32,950 --> 00:16:35,810
They've left.
With just us, we won't be able to do it.

382
00:16:36,190 --> 00:16:38,130
Now that you have absolute confidence,

383
00:16:38,130 --> 00:16:40,260
you kicked everyone out immediately.

384
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:44,280
What a tight plan.

385
00:16:44,790 --> 00:16:46,740
You know me so well now?

386
00:16:47,620 --> 00:16:49,090
So that's what it is.

387
00:16:49,110 --> 00:16:51,440
Kick them all out
so we can make more money.

388
00:16:52,270 --> 00:16:53,860
He doesn't care about money at all.

389
00:16:53,860 --> 00:16:55,270
Of course I do.

390
00:16:56,070 --> 00:16:57,740
I have such a huge debt.

391
00:17:00,250 --> 00:17:01,610
You can...

392
00:17:01,740 --> 00:17:03,670
-go to Miss Chen in Pangzhou—
-Hey!

393
00:17:05,210 --> 00:17:06,520
Why didn't I think of that?

394
00:17:06,520 --> 00:17:07,720
You have a

395
00:17:07,839 --> 00:17:10,390
rich friend, Miss Chen, in Pangzhou.

396
00:17:10,829 --> 00:17:11,760
Ask her for help.

397
00:17:11,770 --> 00:17:13,640
We're just regular friends.

398
00:17:14,040 --> 00:17:16,670
How could I have the nerve to ask her?

399
00:17:18,260 --> 00:17:20,020
If the friend in Pangzhou won't do,

400
00:17:20,020 --> 00:17:21,750
you can find the one in Pujiang.

401
00:17:21,869 --> 00:17:23,780
If not Pujiang, isn't there one in Suzhou?

402
00:17:23,780 --> 00:17:24,910
Anyway, you have many friends.

403
00:17:24,910 --> 00:17:26,700
You don't have to worry about
having no one to back you up.

404
00:17:26,700 --> 00:17:28,260
It also saves us

405
00:17:28,630 --> 00:17:30,060
from working for nothing.

406
00:17:30,060 --> 00:17:31,150
Don't go.

407
00:17:31,150 --> 00:17:32,700
I'm counting on you now.

408
00:17:35,020 --> 00:17:36,300
You still have Liang.

409
00:17:37,630 --> 00:17:38,350
Right.

410
00:17:40,830 --> 00:17:41,980
I will protect you.

411
00:17:47,020 --> 00:17:47,780
Let me go!

412
00:17:47,910 --> 00:17:48,710
Dakui, Erkui,

413
00:17:48,910 --> 00:17:50,220
how dare you arrest me!

414
00:17:50,540 --> 00:17:51,780
Be gentle, you two.

415
00:17:52,070 --> 00:17:52,540
Let me go!

416
00:17:52,540 --> 00:17:53,470
I'm not going in!

417
00:17:56,150 --> 00:17:56,910
Give me the keys!

418
00:17:56,910 --> 00:17:57,840
Give me the keys!

419
00:17:58,460 --> 00:17:58,910
Erkui!

420
00:17:59,300 --> 00:17:59,870
Let me go!

421
00:18:00,150 --> 00:18:01,060
Sorry, Madam.

422
00:18:01,150 --> 00:18:02,500
Dakui, give me the keys!

423
00:18:02,620 --> 00:18:03,950
Did you hear me, you two?

424
00:18:07,630 --> 00:18:08,740
Cao,

425
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:10,290
you ungrateful bastard!

426
00:18:10,630 --> 00:18:11,390
Back then,

427
00:18:11,590 --> 00:18:12,980
if it weren't for my dad,

428
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:15,190
you would've been turned into a human dog!

429
00:18:15,190 --> 00:18:16,020
Let me out!

430
00:18:17,220 --> 00:18:18,080
When will you be

431
00:18:18,460 --> 00:18:20,430
as clear-headed

432
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:21,950
as I am?

433
00:18:22,430 --> 00:18:23,740
Then I'll let you out.

434
00:18:23,870 --> 00:18:25,830
Cao, let me out!

435
00:18:25,830 --> 00:18:27,170
My surname is Aisin Gioro.

436
00:18:27,170 --> 00:18:28,600
Aisin Gioro, you blockhead!

437
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:29,910
You're the blockhead!

438
00:18:31,260 --> 00:18:32,260
Let me out!

439
00:18:33,460 --> 00:18:34,020
Master,

440
00:18:35,150 --> 00:18:36,080
from the eunuch.

441
00:18:38,050 --> 00:18:41,790
[Your Majesty, it's dangerous out there now.
Please secretly head to Yunhe Temple tomorrow; I have important matters to report.]

442
00:19:04,850 --> 00:19:05,680
Your Majesty!

443
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:07,670
Your Majesty!

444
00:19:21,740 --> 00:19:22,540
Your Majesty,

445
00:19:22,630 --> 00:19:24,880
finding you and serving you

446
00:19:25,060 --> 00:19:27,730
makes my life complete.

447
00:19:32,100 --> 00:19:32,910
Look.

448
00:19:33,260 --> 00:19:34,060
This...

449
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:35,910
Hurry up.

450
00:19:35,930 --> 00:19:36,970
Let's go.

451
00:19:48,060 --> 00:19:48,980
Your Majesty,

452
00:19:48,980 --> 00:19:50,260
your mansion

453
00:19:50,260 --> 00:19:52,460
is besieged on all sides.

454
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:53,630
Mr. Shangguan,

455
00:19:53,630 --> 00:19:55,490
in order to stabilize all forces,

456
00:19:55,510 --> 00:19:57,110
disguised himself as you

457
00:19:57,300 --> 00:19:59,580
and continues to live in the residence

458
00:19:59,780 --> 00:20:01,300
to control the situation.

459
00:20:01,740 --> 00:20:04,700
This is what we call

460
00:20:05,190 --> 00:20:06,920
advancing secretly
while feigning a retreat.

461
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:08,120
Your Majesty is wise.

462
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:10,120
For now, just treat this Yunhe Temple

463
00:20:10,120 --> 00:20:13,120
as your temporary palace.

464
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:14,870
What if there's another

465
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:18,390
assassination attempt
at the old residence?

466
00:20:18,390 --> 00:20:20,300
Doggie will lead a team

467
00:20:20,430 --> 00:20:21,700
to guard day and night.

468
00:20:21,910 --> 00:20:23,740
I'm afraid

469
00:20:24,260 --> 00:20:25,220
my wife...

470
00:20:25,460 --> 00:20:28,700
Your Majesty, that's exactly
what I was about to ask.

471
00:20:29,060 --> 00:20:30,740
Do you want to invite

472
00:20:31,190 --> 00:20:33,980
Her Majesty here as well?

473
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:36,260
Eunuch,

474
00:20:37,830 --> 00:20:39,430
what do you think?

475
00:20:45,630 --> 00:20:47,990
To say something treasonous,

476
00:20:48,430 --> 00:20:49,740
the less people know

477
00:20:49,980 --> 00:20:52,780
of this place, the safer.

478
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:54,990
It's better Her Majesty...

479
00:20:57,520 --> 00:20:58,980
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

480
00:20:59,060 --> 00:21:00,110
You may rise.

481
00:21:05,350 --> 00:21:06,810
As for my beloved consort,

482
00:21:07,250 --> 00:21:09,510
how is she recovering from her injuries?

483
00:21:09,910 --> 00:21:11,080
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

484
00:21:11,080 --> 00:21:13,210
Miss Jiang is being well taken care of.

485
00:21:13,740 --> 00:21:15,670
She also instructed me,

486
00:21:15,690 --> 00:21:17,620
saying that Your Majesty loves...

487
00:21:18,340 --> 00:21:19,650
loves to drink this.

488
00:21:20,080 --> 00:21:20,650
Have a cup.

489
00:21:20,650 --> 00:21:21,820
No,

490
00:21:21,850 --> 00:21:22,980
put this down first.

491
00:21:23,010 --> 00:21:24,820
Put it down there.

492
00:21:29,460 --> 00:21:31,390
My beloved consort, she is so thoughtful.

493
00:21:31,390 --> 00:21:32,190
Your Majesty,

494
00:21:32,910 --> 00:21:34,780
you have finished washing up.

495
00:21:35,430 --> 00:21:36,870
We are ready to dress you.

496
00:21:38,260 --> 00:21:38,870
All right.

497
00:21:39,260 --> 00:21:41,120
Please take a look, Your Majesty.

498
00:21:54,740 --> 00:21:55,870
For me?

499
00:21:56,190 --> 00:21:57,260
Yes, Your Majesty.

500
00:21:57,740 --> 00:21:59,260
It is yours.

501
00:22:01,150 --> 00:22:02,060
Mine?

502
00:22:10,260 --> 00:22:11,670
Is this real?

503
00:22:11,740 --> 00:22:13,020
Your Majesty,

504
00:22:13,500 --> 00:22:15,110
all land under heaven belongs to you,

505
00:22:15,110 --> 00:22:16,980
and all people are your subjects.

506
00:22:17,150 --> 00:22:20,260
Who would dare to fake your dragon robe?

507
00:22:22,590 --> 00:22:25,020
I have liked yellow color
since I was a child.

508
00:22:25,020 --> 00:22:25,740
Yes.

509
00:22:26,220 --> 00:22:29,080
You will like it even more
once you are dressed in it.

510
00:22:40,410 --> 00:22:44,140
[A now extinguished fire broke out in Yimin Alley at night.
Fortunately, there are no casualties.]

511
00:22:44,670 --> 00:22:45,500
What?

512
00:22:47,830 --> 00:22:48,850
The old house is on fire?

513
00:22:48,850 --> 00:22:49,850
Let me take a look.

514
00:22:52,780 --> 00:22:54,580
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

515
00:22:54,590 --> 00:22:56,540
I will go check the situation

516
00:22:56,540 --> 00:22:57,980
and report back to you.

517
00:22:58,350 --> 00:22:59,150
Your Majesty!

518
00:23:00,020 --> 00:23:00,740
Lingyu!

519
00:23:02,700 --> 00:23:03,500
Your Majesty!

520
00:23:04,020 --> 00:23:05,880
The fire at the mansion last night

521
00:23:05,910 --> 00:23:07,740
must have been set intentionally.

522
00:23:07,740 --> 00:23:08,630
I saw

523
00:23:08,950 --> 00:23:10,540
many many men in black

524
00:23:10,540 --> 00:23:12,110
broke into the room.

525
00:23:14,020 --> 00:23:15,060
Mr. Shangguan...

526
00:23:15,060 --> 00:23:16,060
What happened to him?

527
00:23:16,060 --> 00:23:17,150
Mr. Shangguan,

528
00:23:17,350 --> 00:23:18,910
with his last breath,

529
00:23:19,590 --> 00:23:20,670
entrusted me

530
00:23:21,190 --> 00:23:23,320
to hand this letter to you personally.

531
00:23:23,830 --> 00:23:25,290
He said only with his death

532
00:23:25,430 --> 00:23:27,830
would those villains truly be at ease.

533
00:23:26,190 --> 00:23:27,640
[For His Majesty's personal receipt]

534
00:23:37,430 --> 00:23:38,760
Long live Your Majesty.

535
00:23:39,170 --> 00:23:40,500
The 29 armies in Peiping

536
00:23:40,500 --> 00:23:42,150
have all been arranged.

537
00:23:42,460 --> 00:23:45,060
Please ensure you depart tomorrow night.

538
00:23:45,350 --> 00:23:46,300
This check

539
00:23:46,540 --> 00:23:48,110
is all we loyal subjects

540
00:23:48,110 --> 00:23:49,190
have.

541
00:23:49,350 --> 00:23:51,410
To have helped you ascend the throne,

542
00:23:51,530 --> 00:23:53,890
I die without regrets.

543
00:23:55,540 --> 00:23:56,340
Your Majesty.

544
00:23:56,550 --> 00:23:58,110
My State Preceptor...

545
00:23:58,500 --> 00:23:59,300
Your Majesty,

546
00:23:59,540 --> 00:24:01,200
please take care of yourself.

547
00:24:01,830 --> 00:24:04,110
Only if you successfully ascend the throne

548
00:24:04,110 --> 00:24:06,110
will the State Preceptor's sacrifice

549
00:24:06,110 --> 00:24:07,190
be meaningful.

550
00:24:08,780 --> 00:24:09,300
How is

551
00:24:09,910 --> 00:24:10,780
the Empress?

552
00:24:11,630 --> 00:24:12,830
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

553
00:24:12,830 --> 00:24:13,590
Her Majesty

554
00:24:13,910 --> 00:24:15,910
has been safely moved
to a civilian residence,

555
00:24:15,910 --> 00:24:17,020
completely unharmed.

556
00:24:17,020 --> 00:24:18,390
For the sake of the big picture,

557
00:24:18,390 --> 00:24:19,220
I believe

558
00:24:19,590 --> 00:24:21,460
it is best for Your Majesty
and the Empress

559
00:24:21,460 --> 00:24:22,950
to return to Peiping separately.

560
00:24:22,950 --> 00:24:23,430
Yes,

561
00:24:23,430 --> 00:24:25,230
Miss Jiang is absolutely right.

562
00:24:25,460 --> 00:24:26,740
How about this, Your Majesty?

563
00:24:26,740 --> 00:24:28,780
You write a letter to Her Highness

564
00:24:28,870 --> 00:24:30,870
explaining the current situation.

565
00:24:31,260 --> 00:24:31,870
Also,

566
00:24:32,830 --> 00:24:34,160
have her cash this draft

567
00:24:34,190 --> 00:24:37,190
at the bank and deposit it

568
00:24:37,740 --> 00:24:39,190
under your name.

569
00:24:42,700 --> 00:24:43,460
That works.

570
00:24:46,260 --> 00:24:47,350
Lingyu risked her life

571
00:24:47,350 --> 00:24:49,190
to get this check back.

572
00:24:49,830 --> 00:24:50,830
I shall let Lingyu

573
00:24:52,010 --> 00:24:53,210
handle it for me.

574
00:24:55,260 --> 00:24:56,590
As you command, Your Majesty.

575
00:24:56,590 --> 00:24:57,460
Please write

576
00:24:58,020 --> 00:24:59,480
a letter of authorization

577
00:24:59,500 --> 00:25:00,900
yourself, Your Majesty.

578
00:25:01,430 --> 00:25:02,630
Bring me brush and ink.

579
00:25:02,630 --> 00:25:03,690
Yes, Your Majesty.

580
00:25:17,460 --> 00:25:18,320
I shall entrust

581
00:25:18,960 --> 00:25:20,920
this heavy responsibility to you.

582
00:25:22,350 --> 00:25:23,300
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

583
00:25:23,300 --> 00:25:24,100
Miss Jiang,

584
00:25:24,260 --> 00:25:25,500
you have to come back immediately

585
00:25:25,500 --> 00:25:26,960
after cashing this check.

586
00:25:26,980 --> 00:25:28,950
Tomorrow night,
you and the Fifth Master will accompany

587
00:25:28,950 --> 00:25:30,910
His Majesty to the Imperial City.

588
00:25:32,350 --> 00:25:33,480
I obey your command.

589
00:25:37,000 --> 00:25:37,720
Eunuch,

590
00:25:38,910 --> 00:25:39,740
what about you?

591
00:25:39,740 --> 00:25:41,110
I'm leaving tonight

592
00:25:41,110 --> 00:25:42,590
to set up security at the station.

593
00:25:42,590 --> 00:25:43,950
For Your Majesty's ascension,

594
00:25:43,950 --> 00:25:46,220
everything must be foolproof.

595
00:25:56,760 --> 00:26:00,290
This is the letter of authorization
written by Cao San himself.

596
00:26:17,150 --> 00:26:18,810
It is indeed exactly the same.

597
00:26:19,920 --> 00:26:22,990
It seems you have learned quite a lot
these past 2 years.

598
00:26:37,890 --> 00:26:39,130
This is for Lao Yang.

599
00:26:39,780 --> 00:26:41,300
This is for Cao San's wife.

600
00:26:50,530 --> 00:26:51,680
Why are you here?

601
00:26:52,120 --> 00:26:54,120
Please calm down, Madam.

602
00:26:59,070 --> 00:27:00,760
[To: Madam]

603
00:27:00,830 --> 00:27:04,190
[Check]

604
00:27:18,060 --> 00:27:19,120
As the saying goes,

605
00:27:19,780 --> 00:27:21,700
the Emperor guards the nation's gates,

606
00:27:21,700 --> 00:27:23,630
and the monarch dies for the state.

607
00:27:23,780 --> 00:27:26,500
His Majesty ascending the throne

608
00:27:26,560 --> 00:27:28,480
is a matter of national importance.

609
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:30,810
We seek your understanding

610
00:27:31,130 --> 00:27:33,530
of His Majesty's good intentions.

611
00:27:33,950 --> 00:27:34,740
Eunuch,

612
00:27:35,220 --> 00:27:36,190
do you also think

613
00:27:36,740 --> 00:27:38,190
he is the Emperor?

614
00:28:09,130 --> 00:28:10,330
Who sent you?

615
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:13,020
It was the Sect Leader.

616
00:28:14,460 --> 00:28:15,390
The Sect Leader?

617
00:28:15,740 --> 00:28:16,630
Yes.

618
00:28:16,830 --> 00:28:17,700
Impossible.

619
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:19,480
You... You are talking nonsense.

620
00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:21,880
How could the Sect Leader
ask you to kill me?

621
00:28:21,960 --> 00:28:23,020
The Sect Leader...

622
00:28:23,180 --> 00:28:25,180
He told me to kill you, Madam.

623
00:28:27,060 --> 00:28:28,130
Words are no proof.

624
00:28:28,290 --> 00:28:29,050
I...

625
00:28:33,040 --> 00:28:34,040
I have a letter.

626
00:28:36,600 --> 00:28:37,560
[To: Yang]

627
00:28:51,500 --> 00:28:52,430
Madam.

628
00:28:53,150 --> 00:28:54,060
Impossible.

629
00:28:55,910 --> 00:28:56,910
Impossible.

630
00:28:57,780 --> 00:29:00,020
Cao San would never

631
00:29:00,680 --> 00:29:02,200
send someone to kill me.

632
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:03,290
Madam.

633
00:29:03,430 --> 00:29:05,630
I have been in the palace for many years.

634
00:29:05,780 --> 00:29:07,260
The dragon throne

635
00:29:07,870 --> 00:29:09,590
is not for any mortal.

636
00:29:10,030 --> 00:29:12,590
That dragon throne is extremely cold.

637
00:29:12,830 --> 00:29:14,350
The heart of the one who sits on it

638
00:29:14,350 --> 00:29:15,300
is even

639
00:29:15,830 --> 00:29:19,390
colder than it.

640
00:29:21,460 --> 00:29:22,830
Cao San and I

641
00:29:23,540 --> 00:29:24,540
have been married

642
00:29:25,300 --> 00:29:26,780
for over 20 years.

643
00:29:28,330 --> 00:29:30,330
How could he bear to kill me?

644
00:29:31,750 --> 00:29:33,900
When he had no food as a child,

645
00:29:35,260 --> 00:29:37,020
I was the one who fed him.

646
00:29:37,500 --> 00:29:40,710
When the old Sect Leader almost
turned him into a human dog,

647
00:29:40,710 --> 00:29:42,710
my father saved him.

648
00:29:44,200 --> 00:29:46,330
How could he be so cruel?

649
00:29:46,630 --> 00:29:48,700
How could he kill me?

650
00:29:49,780 --> 00:29:50,700
Impossible.

651
00:29:51,060 --> 00:29:51,980
Impossible.

652
00:29:52,390 --> 00:29:53,260
Madam,

653
00:29:53,900 --> 00:29:56,470
you can draw a tiger's skin,
but not its bones.

654
00:29:57,070 --> 00:29:59,800
You may know a person's face,
but not their heart.

655
00:30:05,110 --> 00:30:06,630
Cao San...

656
00:30:18,950 --> 00:30:19,780
How is it?

657
00:30:20,080 --> 00:30:21,190
The money is gone.

658
00:30:23,660 --> 00:30:25,220
It's all... gone?

659
00:30:25,500 --> 00:30:26,630
Before you arrived,

660
00:30:26,640 --> 00:30:28,530
Mr. Cao's men withdrew the money.

661
00:30:28,680 --> 00:30:30,160
This is Mr. Cao's authorization letter.

662
00:30:30,160 --> 00:30:32,090
The account and password are on it.

663
00:30:38,670 --> 00:30:40,190
This darn Cao San.

664
00:30:40,460 --> 00:30:42,740
How could he draw all the money?

665
00:30:42,830 --> 00:30:43,460
This dog.

666
00:30:44,460 --> 00:30:45,700
He'll rot in hell.

667
00:30:45,790 --> 00:30:46,700
He'll rot!

668
00:30:47,280 --> 00:30:48,000
Let's go

669
00:30:48,020 --> 00:30:49,280
to the police station.

670
00:30:53,520 --> 00:30:56,270
[Shunxiang Teahouse]

671
00:31:09,460 --> 00:31:12,110
Are all the people in here clean?

672
00:31:12,260 --> 00:31:14,390
These are all your subjects.

673
00:31:14,670 --> 00:31:17,110
I didn't want to make such a big scene,

674
00:31:17,110 --> 00:31:18,540
but the Japanese

675
00:31:18,540 --> 00:31:20,190
have weapons.

676
00:31:20,540 --> 00:31:22,980
Your Majesty, the train leaves tonight.

677
00:31:22,980 --> 00:31:24,210
Once we reach Peiping,

678
00:31:24,210 --> 00:31:27,100
you will be the true Son of Heaven.

679
00:31:27,820 --> 00:31:30,300
Your Majesty, please rest here for now.

680
00:31:30,650 --> 00:31:32,540
Play some cards and have some tea.

681
00:31:33,060 --> 00:31:33,780
Your Majesty,

682
00:31:33,780 --> 00:31:34,780
Fifth Master and I

683
00:31:34,780 --> 00:31:36,510
will go arrange your schedule.

684
00:31:36,870 --> 00:31:38,220
I'll come back to pick you up

685
00:31:38,220 --> 00:31:39,500
in 4 hours.

686
00:31:40,110 --> 00:31:41,430
I shall take my leave.

687
00:31:45,780 --> 00:31:47,020
Wait.

688
00:32:11,500 --> 00:32:12,690
When this is done,

689
00:32:12,990 --> 00:32:15,120
I promise you a position below only one

690
00:32:15,980 --> 00:32:17,410
and above all others.

691
00:32:21,390 --> 00:32:23,590
Thank you for your grace, Your Majesty!

692
00:32:23,810 --> 00:32:24,680
Rise.

693
00:32:25,400 --> 00:32:26,810
And you, Miss Jiang.

694
00:32:27,740 --> 00:32:29,220
You saved my life.

695
00:32:29,410 --> 00:32:30,340
By then,

696
00:32:30,370 --> 00:32:32,890
I'll make you the Noble Consort.

697
00:32:34,740 --> 00:32:36,140
Thank you, Your Majesty.

698
00:32:36,870 --> 00:32:37,730
But Your Majesty,

699
00:32:37,730 --> 00:32:39,850
I do not seek such titles.

700
00:32:39,960 --> 00:32:41,360
I only wish to stay by your side.

701
00:32:41,360 --> 00:32:42,670
Serving you well

702
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:44,730
is more than enough for me.

703
00:32:50,060 --> 00:32:50,890
History

704
00:32:51,450 --> 00:32:53,130
will remember today.

705
00:32:53,980 --> 00:32:56,980
-Long live the Emperor!
-Long live the Emperor!

706
00:32:57,000 --> 00:32:57,990
Go on with your work.

707
00:32:57,990 --> 00:33:00,250
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

708
00:33:06,030 --> 00:33:06,900
Chief,

709
00:33:06,930 --> 00:33:09,780
what did you mean

710
00:33:09,860 --> 00:33:11,660
by catching them in a trap today?

711
00:33:27,360 --> 00:33:28,430
Cao San?

712
00:33:33,190 --> 00:33:34,500
You are...

713
00:33:34,660 --> 00:33:37,460
I am Wang Zhicheng,

714
00:33:37,780 --> 00:33:39,290
Chief of the Yucheng Police Department.

715
00:33:39,290 --> 00:33:41,250
With you protecting me,

716
00:33:41,530 --> 00:33:42,920
I can rest easy.

717
00:33:43,130 --> 00:33:44,300
In the future,

718
00:33:44,320 --> 00:33:46,850
you'll be my Nine Gates'
Infantry Commander.

719
00:33:46,870 --> 00:33:48,790
You're here to...

720
00:33:48,810 --> 00:33:50,250
Have fun with the people.

721
00:33:54,670 --> 00:33:56,400
Do you know how to play mahjong?

722
00:33:57,240 --> 00:33:58,910
Come on, let's play.

723
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:14,380
You know, governing a great nation

724
00:34:14,380 --> 00:34:15,980
is like cooking a small fish,

725
00:34:16,230 --> 00:34:18,139
it must be done slowly.

726
00:34:18,330 --> 00:34:20,250
These days,

727
00:34:20,270 --> 00:34:22,260
it's been hard for me to eat or sleep.

728
00:34:22,260 --> 00:34:24,050
After I ascend the throne,

729
00:34:24,070 --> 00:34:25,710
I will govern with all my might.

730
00:34:25,710 --> 00:34:28,120
Take Yucheng, for example.

731
00:34:28,150 --> 00:34:29,949
The public order is a total mess.

732
00:34:29,980 --> 00:34:31,909
The economy is failing too.

733
00:34:31,909 --> 00:34:32,980
The atmosphere is foul.

734
00:34:32,980 --> 00:34:34,500
This is highly improper.

735
00:34:35,270 --> 00:34:35,980
Kong.

736
00:34:38,159 --> 00:34:38,909
South Wind.

737
00:34:44,620 --> 00:34:46,070
Nine Gates' Infantry Commander.

738
00:34:46,070 --> 00:34:47,030
What's wrong?

739
00:34:49,219 --> 00:34:50,219
I've won.

740
00:34:50,900 --> 00:34:51,699
Good hand.

741
00:34:51,790 --> 00:34:52,830
It's all yours.

742
00:34:53,139 --> 00:34:55,139
But you must

743
00:34:55,170 --> 00:34:57,440
protect Her Majesty well.

744
00:34:58,140 --> 00:34:59,350
No matter what,

745
00:34:59,500 --> 00:35:02,270
Her Majesty is going to Peiping with me.

746
00:35:02,770 --> 00:35:03,920
She can't live without me.

747
00:35:03,920 --> 00:35:04,920
Rest assured,

748
00:35:05,200 --> 00:35:07,550
Her Majesty is with us.

749
00:35:07,570 --> 00:35:08,780
You will see her

750
00:35:08,810 --> 00:35:10,250
very soon.

751
00:35:10,370 --> 00:35:11,570
Good, good.

752
00:35:12,980 --> 00:35:14,180
But,

753
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:17,730
Her Majesty must have complained
a lot to you, right?

754
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:20,040
She said everything she should.

755
00:35:21,230 --> 00:35:24,540
Only believe half of what a woman says.

756
00:35:25,540 --> 00:35:26,750
Her Majesty said

757
00:35:26,770 --> 00:35:28,260
you really killed

758
00:35:28,280 --> 00:35:30,470
the old Sect Leader.

759
00:35:31,780 --> 00:35:34,220
That was a long time ago.

760
00:35:34,280 --> 00:35:35,650
What else did Her Majesty tell you?

761
00:35:35,650 --> 00:35:36,810
I heard

762
00:35:36,850 --> 00:35:39,400
you chopped off that old geezer's head

763
00:35:39,420 --> 00:35:40,940
with your own hands,

764
00:35:40,970 --> 00:35:42,890
and hung it in the hall for 3 days.

765
00:35:42,910 --> 00:35:44,470
I had to chop it off myself.

766
00:35:44,610 --> 00:35:47,000
The Beggar Sect must have its rules.

767
00:35:47,020 --> 00:35:48,350
How ruthless.

768
00:35:48,380 --> 00:35:50,310
Ordinary people couldn't do that.

769
00:35:52,660 --> 00:35:54,340
You are my historian, right?

770
00:35:54,850 --> 00:35:55,560
Yes.

771
00:35:56,960 --> 00:35:58,560
Then write it down in detail.

772
00:36:00,010 --> 00:36:03,270
A while ago, Lincheng's Beggar Gang leader
came to make trouble.

773
00:36:03,270 --> 00:36:05,140
And you put him in his place.

774
00:36:05,790 --> 00:36:06,710
You even know that?

775
00:36:06,710 --> 00:36:07,830
I was right there.

776
00:36:07,850 --> 00:36:09,290
Then I have to ask you.

777
00:36:09,380 --> 00:36:10,750
Did you see

778
00:36:10,780 --> 00:36:12,050
how I did it?

779
00:36:12,120 --> 00:36:14,920
Unfortunately,
I didn't see that with my own eyes.

780
00:36:15,430 --> 00:36:16,360
Write this down.

781
00:36:16,950 --> 00:36:19,980
At that time, 18 men by the river

782
00:36:20,460 --> 00:36:22,230
wanted to steal my empire.

783
00:36:22,260 --> 00:36:24,850
I took 2 short sabers,

784
00:36:24,940 --> 00:36:27,180
and slashed from one end
of the street to the other.

785
00:36:27,180 --> 00:36:27,980
The sabers...

786
00:36:28,830 --> 00:36:30,500
were all chipped.

787
00:36:30,740 --> 00:36:32,860
The ground was covered in blood.

788
00:36:32,970 --> 00:36:35,860
It squelched when you stepped on it.

789
00:36:36,330 --> 00:36:39,100
Guess why I wasn't hurt?

790
00:36:39,410 --> 00:36:40,450
Why?

791
00:36:40,650 --> 00:36:42,440
Highlight this part.

792
00:36:43,320 --> 00:36:45,250
It's because of the scar on my back—

793
00:36:45,770 --> 00:36:47,040
it's the dragon vein!

794
00:36:49,810 --> 00:36:51,140
Isn't that the scar left

795
00:36:51,180 --> 00:36:53,430
by the old Sect Leader

796
00:36:53,430 --> 00:36:56,390
when he tried to mutilate you
into a human dog?

797
00:36:58,110 --> 00:36:58,950
Insolent!

798
00:37:02,630 --> 00:37:03,630
What do you mean?

799
00:37:05,480 --> 00:37:06,730
What do you all mean?

800
00:37:06,980 --> 00:37:08,390
Are you trying to rebel?

801
00:37:27,310 --> 00:37:28,020
Brilliant.

802
00:37:28,310 --> 00:37:29,500
The Japanese

803
00:37:29,500 --> 00:37:31,140
would never have thought

804
00:37:31,140 --> 00:37:32,180
we would put on an act

805
00:37:32,180 --> 00:37:33,660
like this to escape.

806
00:37:33,660 --> 00:37:34,980
Who came up with this?

807
00:37:34,980 --> 00:37:36,430
This is too brilliant.

808
00:37:37,020 --> 00:37:39,660
Right, if we're acting,
let's do the full set.

809
00:37:39,660 --> 00:37:40,390
Don't just stand there.

810
00:37:40,390 --> 00:37:41,060
Who has handcuffs?

811
00:37:41,060 --> 00:37:42,580
Hurry up and cuff me.

812
00:37:42,580 --> 00:37:43,460
Cuff him.

813
00:37:43,460 --> 00:37:44,800
Hurry!

814
00:37:46,700 --> 00:37:48,370
I'll do it myself.

815
00:37:50,320 --> 00:37:52,600
What a great trick

816
00:37:52,950 --> 00:37:54,280
of advancing secretly.

817
00:37:54,390 --> 00:37:55,180
Come on.

818
00:37:55,210 --> 00:37:56,480
Arrest me.

819
00:37:57,060 --> 00:37:58,350
Escort me to Peiping.

820
00:37:58,390 --> 00:37:59,230
He talks too much.

821
00:37:59,230 --> 00:38:00,140
Take him down.

822
00:38:00,140 --> 00:38:00,940
Take him away.

823
00:38:01,430 --> 00:38:02,230
Take him away.

824
00:38:32,120 --> 00:38:33,960
Such a big scene.

825
00:38:35,030 --> 00:38:36,890
This isn't just putting on an act.

826
00:38:37,560 --> 00:38:39,390
This is putting on a full act.

827
00:38:46,460 --> 00:38:47,620
I am the Emperor.

828
00:38:48,140 --> 00:38:49,100
You know that, right?

829
00:38:49,100 --> 00:38:50,360
And I'm the Lord of Heaven.

830
00:38:50,360 --> 00:38:51,290
Kneel properly!

831
00:38:53,450 --> 00:38:54,530
I have to say,

832
00:38:54,560 --> 00:38:56,560
these guys are acting pretty well.

833
00:39:01,980 --> 00:39:02,870
Li Mazi,

834
00:39:02,870 --> 00:39:03,910
guilty of murder,

835
00:39:03,910 --> 00:39:04,950
arson,

836
00:39:04,950 --> 00:39:06,230
rape of women.

837
00:39:06,390 --> 00:39:07,750
Punished for multiple crimes,

838
00:39:07,750 --> 00:39:08,830
he is sentenced to death by shooting—

839
00:39:08,830 --> 00:39:10,430
to be executed immediately.

840
00:39:18,390 --> 00:39:20,540
Wang Dabao, guilty of murder

841
00:39:21,120 --> 00:39:22,320
and burglary.

842
00:39:22,660 --> 00:39:24,100
Punished for multiple crimes,

843
00:39:24,100 --> 00:39:25,220
he is sentenced to death by shooting—

844
00:39:25,220 --> 00:39:26,820
to be executed immediately.

845
00:39:32,480 --> 00:39:35,000
Peng Sanchuan, guilty of banditry,

846
00:39:35,050 --> 00:39:36,010
murder,

847
00:39:36,370 --> 00:39:37,440
robbery,

848
00:39:37,530 --> 00:39:38,610
and rape.

849
00:39:38,870 --> 00:39:40,020
He is sentenced to death by shooting—

850
00:39:40,020 --> 00:39:41,620
to be executed immediately.

851
00:39:43,100 --> 00:39:43,870
Liars!

852
00:39:44,130 --> 00:39:45,410
You're all liars!

853
00:39:48,260 --> 00:39:49,520
How could I be scammed?

854
00:39:49,980 --> 00:39:51,710
I am the Emperor!

855
00:39:55,800 --> 00:39:58,000
I wonder if Mr. Cao's General Longxiang

856
00:39:58,180 --> 00:39:59,020
is for sale?

857
00:39:59,020 --> 00:40:00,020
Greetings.

858
00:40:00,350 --> 00:40:01,500
And this is?

859
00:40:01,750 --> 00:40:03,100
I can only tell you

860
00:40:03,230 --> 00:40:04,460
his surname is Aisin Gioro.

861
00:40:04,460 --> 00:40:06,140
You're interested in this item?

862
00:40:06,140 --> 00:40:07,520
What you see may not be real.

863
00:40:07,520 --> 00:40:08,890
What you see is real.

864
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:10,250
To see the mystery,

865
00:40:10,270 --> 00:40:12,400
the hidden dragon must reveal itself.

866
00:40:12,430 --> 00:40:15,540
Long live the Emperor!

867
00:40:15,540 --> 00:40:16,710
Did something grow

868
00:40:16,920 --> 00:40:18,560
on Sect Leader Cao's back?

869
00:40:18,620 --> 00:40:19,540
What grew?

870
00:40:19,750 --> 00:40:20,710
The dragon vein.

871
00:40:21,500 --> 00:40:22,310
It appeared!

872
00:40:22,310 --> 00:40:23,750
This is simply the will of Heaven!

873
00:40:23,750 --> 00:40:25,100
The dragon vein is finally continued.

874
00:40:25,100 --> 00:40:27,060
The Great Qing will not fall!

875
00:40:27,060 --> 00:40:28,910
The heavy responsibility of restoring
the Qing Dynasty

876
00:40:28,910 --> 00:40:30,750
now rests in your hands.

877
00:40:30,750 --> 00:40:31,870
When we get to Peiping,

878
00:40:31,870 --> 00:40:34,460
you will be the true Son of Heaven.

879
00:40:35,430 --> 00:40:36,020
Cao San,

880
00:40:36,580 --> 00:40:37,620
guilty of murder,

881
00:40:38,020 --> 00:40:39,180
child abuse,

882
00:40:39,580 --> 00:40:40,780
false imprisonment,

883
00:40:41,140 --> 00:40:42,470
and instigating theft.

884
00:40:42,710 --> 00:40:44,300
The facts of the crimes are clear,

885
00:40:44,300 --> 00:40:45,830
and the evidence is irrefutable.

886
00:40:45,830 --> 00:40:47,630
Upon trial by the Yucheng Court,

887
00:40:47,750 --> 00:40:48,750
you are sentenced

888
00:40:49,040 --> 00:40:50,170
to death by shooting

889
00:40:50,460 --> 00:40:52,180
and deprived of political rights for life—

890
00:40:52,180 --> 00:40:53,780
to be executed immediately.

891
00:40:54,500 --> 00:40:57,100
I am truly the only one
who sees things clearly.

892
00:41:46,180 --> 00:41:49,430
Here's the deed to the three-courtyard
house in the west of the city.

893
00:41:49,430 --> 00:41:51,290
The car is parked in the backyard.

894
00:41:51,830 --> 00:41:53,430
Everything promised before

895
00:41:53,580 --> 00:41:55,210
has been settled.

896
00:42:01,740 --> 00:42:02,850
Good job.

897
00:42:04,980 --> 00:42:07,100
Why does it feel like
something is missing?

898
00:42:07,100 --> 00:42:07,970
I remember now.

899
00:42:08,500 --> 00:42:09,870
There are 13 boxes of silver coins

900
00:42:09,870 --> 00:42:11,620
in Cao San’s warehouse.

901
00:42:11,710 --> 00:42:12,460
Where is the money?

902
00:42:12,460 --> 00:42:13,710
In your name,

903
00:42:13,740 --> 00:42:15,650
it was all donated to an orphanage.

904
00:42:15,650 --> 00:42:16,580
What did you say?

905
00:42:16,740 --> 00:42:18,870
The first rule of our Tianxiang Sect is

906
00:42:19,140 --> 00:42:20,060
unlawful money

907
00:42:20,230 --> 00:42:22,460
should be scattered in natural disasters.

908
00:42:22,460 --> 00:42:23,460
Bullshit!

909
00:42:23,460 --> 00:42:24,660
The brothers of our Tianxiang Sect

910
00:42:24,660 --> 00:42:26,580
risk their lives to make money,

911
00:42:26,700 --> 00:42:27,740
not to do charity.

912
00:42:27,770 --> 00:42:30,460
Shouldn't the Tianxiang Sect
be robbing the rich to help the poor?

913
00:42:30,460 --> 00:42:31,950
It's a good donation.

914
00:42:32,320 --> 00:42:33,690
This orphanage

915
00:42:33,720 --> 00:42:35,620
is better than 12 boxes of silver dollars.

916
00:42:35,620 --> 00:42:38,180
Thank you all for your strong support.

917
00:42:38,630 --> 00:42:41,060
Nanxi Orphanage opens today.

918
00:42:41,290 --> 00:42:43,210
For the homeless children,

919
00:42:44,180 --> 00:42:45,860
I thank you all.

920
00:42:57,080 --> 00:43:00,120
[Nanxi Orphanage Opening Ceremony]

921
00:42:57,470 --> 00:42:58,760
Nanxi...

922
00:43:00,540 --> 00:43:01,910
Why did you name

923
00:43:01,910 --> 00:43:03,230
the orphanage this?

924
00:43:03,260 --> 00:43:04,740
Is there a story behind it?

925
00:43:07,890 --> 00:43:10,090
Yanzi, I smashed the Xuande Jar for you,

926
00:43:10,210 --> 00:43:11,410
and I have no regrets.

927
00:43:14,720 --> 00:43:15,640
You brat.

928
00:43:15,660 --> 00:43:17,740
Let's settle our scores later.

929
00:43:20,830 --> 00:43:21,710
Second Batou,

930
00:43:22,270 --> 00:43:23,210
have you forgotten?

931
00:43:23,210 --> 00:43:26,290
Cao San still has some authentic pieces.

932
00:43:35,910 --> 00:43:37,190
I didn't expect

933
00:43:37,510 --> 00:43:39,470
he would really succeed.

934
00:43:39,490 --> 00:43:41,610
I thought he was just a greenhorn,

935
00:43:42,020 --> 00:43:44,460
but he turned out to be a nuisance.

936
00:43:45,570 --> 00:43:46,700
A nuisance?

937
00:43:48,000 --> 00:43:50,200
I actually find him quite interesting.

938
00:43:50,620 --> 00:43:53,420
The Sect Master placed
a troublemaker in the hall.

939
00:43:53,520 --> 00:43:55,250
Do you think he's being smart,

940
00:43:56,170 --> 00:43:57,920
or is he just getting senile?

941
00:44:10,020 --> 00:44:11,750
You've found a kindred spirit.

942
00:44:13,290 --> 00:44:15,400
When you are lost in the darkness,

943
00:44:15,420 --> 00:44:17,060
look to the light.

944
00:44:18,000 --> 00:44:20,230
When you've been in the dark for too long,

945
00:44:20,230 --> 00:44:22,100
someone has to crack it open

946
00:44:22,620 --> 00:44:23,950
to let the light in.

947
00:44:30,980 --> 00:44:31,710
Hey,

948
00:44:31,910 --> 00:44:33,180
I just remembered.

949
00:44:33,660 --> 00:44:36,120
Why didn't the old eunuch
who helped us come?

950
00:44:37,630 --> 00:44:39,070
He leaves after the deed is done,

951
00:44:39,070 --> 00:44:41,110
seeking neither fame nor credit.

952
00:44:43,500 --> 00:44:44,630
The eunuch is indeed

953
00:44:45,170 --> 00:44:46,500
a man of hidden talents.

954
00:44:46,520 --> 00:44:47,840
It's just a small trick.

955
00:44:47,840 --> 00:44:49,470
It must be a joke to you.

956
00:44:50,430 --> 00:44:51,350
Steady now.

957
00:44:51,980 --> 00:44:53,850
Don't bite off more than you can chew,

958
00:44:53,850 --> 00:44:55,980
and don't act before the time is right.

959
00:44:56,790 --> 00:44:58,660
I couldn't ask for more
than to join forces

960
00:44:58,660 --> 00:44:59,860
with the Fifth Batou.

961
00:44:59,980 --> 00:45:00,980
Join forces?

962
00:45:01,010 --> 00:45:01,590
I'm here too.

963
00:45:01,590 --> 00:45:03,050
Don't forget about Liang.

964
00:45:03,060 --> 00:45:03,830
Right.

965
00:45:04,020 --> 00:45:05,540
You still have Liang.

966
00:45:05,910 --> 00:45:07,060
For your

967
00:45:07,500 --> 00:45:08,310
Liang,

968
00:45:09,430 --> 00:45:10,910
stay alive

969
00:45:11,460 --> 00:45:12,720
in our Tianxiang Sect.

970
00:45:14,430 --> 00:45:15,750
What you did

971
00:45:15,750 --> 00:45:17,310
is truly a heroic act

972
00:45:17,330 --> 00:45:19,170
benefiting the country and the people.

973
00:45:19,170 --> 00:45:20,500
That's not quite right.

974
00:45:21,010 --> 00:45:23,340
We must credit your brilliance

975
00:45:23,370 --> 00:45:24,940
for catching that beast, Cao San.

976
00:45:24,940 --> 00:45:27,420
Otherwise, how many more children
would have suffered?

977
00:45:27,420 --> 00:45:28,350
Don't you agree?

978
00:45:29,040 --> 00:45:30,850
Since I met Sect Leader,

979
00:45:30,910 --> 00:45:32,350
things have been going smoothly.

980
00:45:32,350 --> 00:45:33,390
Rest assured.

981
00:45:33,390 --> 00:45:35,180
From now on, in this territory,

982
00:45:35,180 --> 00:45:37,500
we are in this

983
00:45:38,060 --> 00:45:39,140
together.

984
00:47:13,410 --> 00:47:15,410
[In the next episode]

985
00:47:15,460 --> 00:47:17,100
Are you human?

986
00:47:17,390 --> 00:47:19,020
Have you no humanity?

987
00:47:19,180 --> 00:47:20,390
People like Tang Yushan

988
00:47:20,390 --> 00:47:21,750
aren't scared of ghosts and deities.

989
00:47:21,750 --> 00:47:23,270
They won't buy it.

990
00:47:23,530 --> 00:47:24,770
He's not afraid of ghosts

991
00:47:24,770 --> 00:47:26,970
because he's never seen ghosts before.

992
00:47:29,560 --> 00:47:31,140
To seek justice for a dead person—

993
00:47:31,140 --> 00:47:32,340
is it worth it?

994
00:47:39,000 --> 00:47:39,890
I'll

995
00:47:40,330 --> 00:47:41,210
accept this round.
